---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Disclosure"
	description="Yeh Bro affiliate and advertising disclosure — commissions, how we pick products, and what we never promote."
>
	<article class="prose-wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
		<h1>Disclosure</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Plain English. We aim not to mislead under Australian Consumer Law. This is not legal advice.
		</p>

		<h2>Who we are</h2>
		<p>
			Yeh Bro is an Australia-focused fitness content brand. We cover training and legal sports
			nutrition for natural lifters.
		</p>

		<h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>
		<p>
			We may earn a commission if you buy through our links, at no extra cost to you. Product links in
			guides go through <code>/go/[slug]</code> redirects so we can update offers without rewriting
			every article.
		</p>

		<h2>How we choose products</h2>
		<p>
			We weigh evidence, label transparency, dosing clarity, AU availability, and value. We do not
			rank products solely because a network pays more.
		</p>

		<h2>Advertising</h2>
		<p>
			Paid partnerships and sponsored content will be labelled “Sponsored” or “Paid partnership.”
			Day-to-day affiliate links use on-page disclosure notes and this page.
		</p>

		<h2>No medical advice</h2>
		<p>
			Content is general training and sports nutrition information. It is not TGA therapeutic advice
			and does not diagnose, treat, or replace care from a qualified professional.
		</p>

		<h2>What we don’t promote</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Illegal AAS / anabolic steroids</li>
			<li>Restricted SARMs and unapproved peptides</li>
			<li>Grey-market “cycle,” “blast,” or PCT drug-style funnels</li>
			<li>Guaranteed muscle or fat-loss claims from powders alone</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Accuracy</h2>
		<p>
			Prices and stock change. Check the retailer. We date-stamp guides and update when material facts
			change.
		</p>

		<h2>Australia / ACL</h2>
		<p>
			We aim for clear, non-misleading claims. If something looks wrong, <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>Disclosure questions: <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
